01:22.100 --> 01:28.020
www.saizen-fansubs.com

01:22.100 --> 01:28.020
#saizen@irc.rizon.net

01:29.340 --> 01:34.140
Paris - France

01:34.650 --> 01:37.920
So you're not going to join our team?

01:37.920 --> 01:43.740
Of course I want to play soccer, but it's my father who decides how long I'm staying in France.

01:43.740 --> 01:48.030
If I were to enter a club now, it would just cause some problems.

01:48.030 --> 01:50.380
That's true. Your father's an artist.

01:50.380 --> 01:56.070
If a player as good as you were to join our team, we'd be extremely grateful.

01:56.070 --> 01:57.340
It's too bad.

02:04.580 --> 02:06.230
He's really good...

02:06.230 --> 02:08.860
It's as if the ball is alive.

02:08.860 --> 02:09.580
True!

02:24.070 --> 02:24.900
Watch out!

02:29.110 --> 02:30.810
Hey, you, be careful!

02:32.230 --> 02:34.340
Taro... Misaki, right?

02:37.130 --> 02:38.950
Are you okay, Misaki?

02:38.950 --> 02:40.860
Hey, you! You should be more careful!

02:43.070 --> 02:46.850
He's Elle-Sid Pierre from the French Junior Youth team!

02:48.100 --> 02:49.370
Pierre...?

02:55.220 --> 03:00.380
<b>The Golden Duo Reunites</b>

02:55.220 --> 03:00.380
<b>The Golden Duo Reunites</b>

03:04.530 --> 03:08.540
Back when I played in the French National League,

03:09.450 --> 03:14.540
I heard about a guy who had superior technical skills.

03:16.020 --> 03:17.660
Even better than mine.

03:19.850 --> 03:21.340
I wanted to meet him.

03:26.060 --> 03:28.480
Let's cut the chatter!

03:28.480 --> 03:30.540
I'm challenging you, Taro Misaki!

03:31.090 --> 03:32.900
You won't be able to take it this time.

03:32.900 --> 03:36.500
Go, Misaki! Don't let him win!

03:41.620 --> 03:44.180
The rumor has some truth. He's not half bad!

03:44.830 --> 03:47.810
If I joined a club somewhere,

03:47.810 --> 03:51.340
I'd be able to play soccer with guys of same level as Pierre!

03:52.180 --> 03:53.690
Misaki, or Pierre...

03:53.690 --> 03:56.060
Which of them is the better technical player?

04:00.300 --> 04:02.520
Which of us will be able to keep that ball?

04:02.520 --> 04:03.700
All right, the challenge is on!

04:08.060 --> 04:08.620
What?

04:09.720 --> 04:11.620
Who's interfering over there?

04:14.140 --> 04:18.100
Misaki-kun, that uniform's yours.

04:19.570 --> 04:20.640
This is...!

04:21.540 --> 04:23.620
The Japanese team...

04:23.620 --> 04:28.880
Two weeks from now, the Junior Youth Soccer Championship will be held here in France.

04:28.880 --> 04:33.720
I would like you to take part by wearing that Number 11 uniform.

04:34.900 --> 04:37.160
Me take part in the Junior Youth Championship?!

04:37.700 --> 04:39.490
I see.

04:39.490 --> 04:41.170
Then it's perfect timing.

04:41.170 --> 04:45.140
We'll settle who has the better technique at the tournament.

04:46.290 --> 04:51.760
It was only the game against Germany, lead by Schneider, that I was looking forward to,

04:51.760 --> 04:55.500
but now there's someone else I'm looking forward to.

04:59.500 --> 05:01.070
Pierre!

05:01.070 --> 05:04.970
I'd like to challenge you officially, but...

05:05.770 --> 05:08.020
The Junior Youth...

05:08.850 --> 05:10.060
What's the matter?

05:20.620 --> 05:22.570
We're here!

05:22.570 --> 05:25.820
We've arrived at our final destination: France!

05:25.820 --> 05:29.050
I already want to eat some Japanese food...

05:29.050 --> 05:32.300
You're saying that now, but if there's French cuisine at the dinner,

05:32.300 --> 05:34.660
you're going to eat for two!

05:34.660 --> 05:37.820
If we're talking about portions for you, let's say five instead!

05:38.580 --> 05:41.540
Okay, everyone. The tournament's in three days.

05:41.540 --> 05:46.090
You're free today, so rest well.

05:46.090 --> 05:48.020
Once we've reached the hotel, you'll be free.

05:48.020 --> 05:48.960
Understood!

05:49.580 --> 05:51.580
Guys, you came!

05:51.580 --> 05:52.800
Katagiri-san!

05:54.860 --> 05:57.380
Were you able to meet Misaki-kun?

05:57.380 --> 05:58.380
Yeah.

05:58.380 --> 06:00.900
I asked him to rejoin the team,

06:00.900 --> 06:04.630
but it seems he's hesitating.

06:04.630 --> 06:07.930
Huh? Misaki-kun's hesitating?

06:08.960 --> 06:12.110
Misaki-kun... Why are you hesitating?

06:20.810 --> 06:22.860
We were told to get some rest,

06:23.300 --> 06:25.660
but I really can't stand around and do nothing!

06:27.180 --> 06:30.260
The Eiffel Tower, eh? It's huge!

06:40.710 --> 06:42.070
Tsubasa-kun...

06:42.070 --> 06:43.220
Tsubasa-kun!

06:43.220 --> 06:44.340
Misaki-kun!

06:46.660 --> 06:49.060
It's been a while, Misaki-kun!

06:49.060 --> 06:50.060
Tsuabsa-kun!

06:50.060 --> 06:52.250
Yeah, there's no doubt about it. It's you, Tsubasa-kun!

06:56.710 --> 06:58.660
I've been in France for three years.

06:59.470 --> 07:01.850
Even though I keep practicing soccer,

07:01.850 --> 07:05.550
I don't have a real coach.

07:05.550 --> 07:08.010
If I were to join the team now,

07:08.010 --> 07:11.270
wouldn't I be a drag on everyone?

07:11.270 --> 07:12.410
I'm uncertain.

07:12.410 --> 07:13.820
Misaki-kun...

07:17.610 --> 07:19.730
Since we first met,

07:19.730 --> 07:23.380
we've been a splendid duo, you and I.

07:23.380 --> 07:26.100
And I'm sure it'll be the same this time!

07:26.560 --> 07:28.100
Tsubasa-kun...

07:28.100 --> 07:30.580
Let's play soccer together again!

07:41.220 --> 07:43.020
Nice to meet you.

07:43.970 --> 07:45.740
I'm Misaki Taro.

07:45.740 --> 07:48.150
Misaki? It's been a while!

07:48.150 --> 07:49.550
How are you?

07:49.550 --> 07:51.010
I'm counting on you again.

07:51.010 --> 07:51.760
Nah, we are.

07:51.760 --> 07:52.380
Let's do our best!

07:53.740 --> 07:55.420
Tsubasa. Misaki.

07:55.420 --> 07:56.540
Yes.

07:56.540 --> 08:00.660
Since you two are finally reunited, show us how you pass the ball around.

08:00.660 --> 08:01.620
Yes!

08:07.780 --> 08:09.160
Tsuabsa and Misaki...

08:09.160 --> 08:11.580
It's been three years since they played together.

08:11.580 --> 08:14.690
Will they play together as well as they did before?

08:14.690 --> 08:17.580
Is that Misaki kid really that good?

08:17.580 --> 08:19.500
Well, just watch.

08:22.100 --> 08:24.100
Alright, let's do this, Misaki!

08:24.100 --> 08:24.860
Yeah!

08:34.060 --> 08:36.080
They're fast! Even after three years!

08:36.080 --> 08:38.920
Even at that speed, their ball handling is perfect.

08:38.920 --> 08:40.550
They're really something.

08:40.550 --> 08:42.060
Of course!

08:42.060 --> 08:45.580
They're not called the Golden Duo for nothing.

08:50.100 --> 08:51.980
Misaki-kun, this one's the last!

08:51.980 --> 08:52.940
Okay!

08:55.100 --> 08:56.980
Nice header, Misaki-kun!

08:56.980 --> 08:59.480
Nice pass, Tsubasa-kun!

08:59.480 --> 09:01.540
You two did great!

09:01.540 --> 09:03.540
They're really the ultimate duo.

09:03.540 --> 09:06.610
Tsubasa's technique has improved a lot.

09:06.610 --> 09:09.540
Yeah, it was the right decision to get Misaki.

09:09.980 --> 09:11.740
That's just like you, Tsubasa-kun.

09:11.740 --> 09:13.690
You're still impressive after these three years.

09:13.690 --> 09:17.410
I had to give it my all to keep up with your speed!

09:17.410 --> 09:19.490
The same goes for me.

09:19.490 --> 09:22.800
All that's left is to show our Golden Duo in the championship!

09:22.800 --> 09:23.820
Yes!

09:23.820 --> 09:28.220
Tomorrow, the International Junior Youth Championship will start!

09:28.220 --> 09:29.120
Listen, everyone!

09:29.120 --> 09:32.340
As the national team of Japan, let's not embarrass ourselves out there!

09:32.340 --> 09:34.220
Yes!

09:39.860 --> 09:43.740
International Stadium of Paris

09:46.260 --> 09:48.210
The crowd's going wild!

09:48.210 --> 09:50.090
The stadium's packed!

09:50.090 --> 09:55.720
The much anticipated International Junior Youth Championship is starting now!

09:56.260 --> 10:03.260
<b>|</b>

09:56.260 --> 10:03.260
<b>Ohzora</b>

09:59.390 --> 10:01.460
Welcome. Come on in.

10:01.460 --> 10:03.260
Sorry for coming so late at night!

10:04.210 --> 10:06.140
Everyone's here!

10:06.140 --> 10:08.130
You're late!

10:08.130 --> 10:10.960
The opening ceremony has already started.

10:10.960 --> 10:14.180
The teams are about to enter.

10:14.180 --> 10:16.050
We've been waiting for this!

10:16.050 --> 10:17.940
Will Japan be okay?

10:17.940 --> 10:19.330
Easy breezy!

10:19.330 --> 10:21.320
Japan has Tsubasa and Misaki.

10:21.320 --> 10:24.060
In addition, Hyuga and Matsuyama are there.

10:24.700 --> 10:26.050
Tsubasa-kun...

10:27.080 --> 10:31.030
The first team to enter is being led by the number one European goalkeeper,

10:31.030 --> 10:32.790
the famous Zino Hernandez.

10:32.790 --> 10:34.840
Here's the well-known Italian team.

10:36.310 --> 10:40.540
Next up is the team led by Juan Diaz, the player of the decade!

10:40.540 --> 10:43.130
These are the future stars of football, Argentina!

10:43.580 --> 10:49.100
The favorites to win, Germany, led by the Young Emperor, Karl Heinz Schneider!

10:49.580 --> 10:55.060
Centered around Elle-Sid Pierre, at their home field, here's the very technical French team!{}{}

10:55.060 --> 11:00.060
And finally, the Japanese Junior Youth team, who has come to Europe.

11:00.060 --> 11:04.040
How far will this team be able to go in this championship against the best teams in the world?

11:04.040 --> 11:05.620
Courage, Japan!

11:05.620 --> 11:09.540
This is a big step toward the world.

11:09.540 --> 11:14.580
We're going to win this championship and prove to the whole world what we're worth!

11:23.610 --> 11:26.140
The ceremony is now over, and we're ready to begin!

11:26.140 --> 11:31.230
The opening game of this championship will be between Italy and Japan!

11:32.220 --> 11:35.340
Ohzora Tsuabsa, you're the captain of this team.

11:35.340 --> 11:36.370
I am?

11:36.960 --> 11:42.170
The one who took this team to Europe: that's you, Tsubasa.

11:42.170 --> 11:44.300
Everyone recognizes that.

11:44.300 --> 11:45.860
Yeah!

11:46.500 --> 11:47.740
Guys...

11:47.740 --> 11:49.660
Okay! You can count on me!

11:55.550 --> 11:59.140
No doubt about it: the captain armband really fits you!

11:59.140 --> 12:00.900
One more thing.

12:02.570 --> 12:06.800
The one who's been coaching you up till now, Misugi Jun,

12:06.800 --> 12:10.660
will be taking part in this championship as a player!

12:10.660 --> 12:15.010
He won't be playing for long periods, and he'll only enter during critical moments.

12:15.010 --> 12:16.860
I'm counting on you all!

12:16.860 --> 12:17.840
Misugi-kun!

12:17.840 --> 12:19.040
Misugi!

12:19.040 --> 12:19.820
Let's do this!

12:20.270 --> 12:23.580
We have to win this game against Italy at all costs!

12:23.580 --> 12:27.040
We'll make them regret blowing off that friendly game!

12:27.040 --> 12:27.920
Guys!

12:27.920 --> 12:33.670
To get past the preliminary groups, we have to win this game against Italy at all costs!

12:49.130 --> 12:51.140
The tournament is finally about to start.

12:51.140 --> 12:55.140
Ohzora Tsubasa and his teammates will be going up against the whole world.

12:55.140 --> 12:59.140
The first step toward this huge dream has been taken!

12:59.140 --> 13:03.740
Now it's finally time for the kick-off in the game between Japan and Italy.

13:05.500 --> 13:09.260
How will Japan do against the talented Italian team?

13:09.800 --> 13:14.180
Italy is making some fast passes, and they are rapidly reaching the deserted wing.

13:14.180 --> 13:15.420
Damn them!

13:16.620 --> 13:18.560
One fake, and he's past the defender!

13:18.560 --> 13:20.610
After the fake, he puts it in the center!

13:21.150 --> 13:22.580
I've got it!

13:22.470 --> 13:23.630
Italy's reaching the center...

13:23.630 --> 13:25.260
... and heads the ball!

13:25.260 --> 13:27.150
Will Italy open the score?

13:27.150 --> 13:28.660
He blocked it!

13:28.660 --> 13:31.960
The keeper, Wakashimazu, dives and saves the shot!

13:31.960 --> 13:34.270
Come on! Let's counterattack!

13:34.870 --> 13:36.860
Now it's Japan on the attack.

13:36.860 --> 13:40.460
But the Italians are already rapidly gaining on the one in possession of the ball, Ohzora Tsubasa!

13:40.460 --> 13:42.860
They're hurrying to attack!

13:42.860 --> 13:44.140
Here I go.

13:44.140 --> 13:46.100
It's a body-to-body challenge!

13:46.100 --> 13:51.840
Ohzora Tsubasa is going past the solid defense of the famous Italian team!

13:51.840 --> 13:55.610
He's really living up to being the prodigy of Japanese soccer, Ohzora Tsubasa!

13:55.610 --> 13:56.820
What superb feinting!

13:58.700 --> 13:59.650
Tsubasa!

13:59.650 --> 14:00.460
Look out!

14:00.460 --> 14:03.130
The two Italians charge in violently!

14:07.220 --> 14:08.510
Foul!

14:08.510 --> 14:11.460
That's a foul if I've ever seen one.

14:12.210 --> 14:13.660
He's not moving!

14:13.660 --> 14:17.500
Ohzora Tsubasa was already late participating in the European tour due to an injury,

14:17.500 --> 14:20.190
so let's hope this one won't be too serious.

14:20.190 --> 14:21.800
Are you okay?

14:21.800 --> 14:24.740
Yeah, I'm okay.

14:24.740 --> 14:27.080
Ohzora Tsubasa is back on his feet.

14:27.080 --> 14:28.920
It looks like he's okay.

14:29.500 --> 14:34.020
Don't give in, Tsubasa! Every star player's bound to get some "special attention."

14:40.590 --> 14:42.420
I'm not giving up yet!

14:50.900 --> 14:53.640
Italy quickly fouls for the third time.

14:53.640 --> 14:55.940
And Ohzora Tsubasa was targeted again!

14:55.940 --> 14:59.140
The Italian team gets a warning.

14:59.140 --> 15:00.160
Tsubasa!

15:00.160 --> 15:03.460
They're going to continue aiming for Tsubasa!

15:07.340 --> 15:11.340
Yeah, we only need to put guys on him.

15:11.340 --> 15:12.930
Now's our chance, guys!

15:13.520 --> 15:17.060
We can aim directly at the goal from here!

15:18.490 --> 15:21.830
But they know about your Drive Shot!

15:21.830 --> 15:23.590
That's why it's up to Matsuyama-kun.

15:27.480 --> 15:29.930
It's now a free kick in front of Italy's goal.

15:29.930 --> 15:33.380
Will Japan go directly for the goal?

15:33.920 --> 15:36.380
Italy's defending with a wall.

15:36.380 --> 15:39.540
He's definitely preparing his Drive Shot and aiming for the goal.

15:39.540 --> 15:40.180
Yeah.

15:41.900 --> 15:47.460
Will Japan be able to score against Europe's number one keeper, Hernandez?

15:49.270 --> 15:54.460
Ohzora Tsubasa's moving toward the ball, so he's really going to be the one to shoot!

15:54.460 --> 15:56.380
Here it comes! Jump!

16:00.180 --> 16:01.140
What?!

16:01.140 --> 16:02.470
He didn't shoot!

16:02.470 --> 16:04.940
It's Matsuyama, who was hiding, who does!

16:04.940 --> 16:06.940
This one's mine!

16:06.940 --> 16:09.140
Here I go: Eagle Shot!

16:11.340 --> 16:13.980
He did it! The plan worked!

16:14.900 --> 16:16.500
He stopped it!

16:16.500 --> 16:19.780
He caught Matsuyama's furious shot with only one hand!

16:19.780 --> 16:22.190
What incredible reflexes Hernandez has!

16:22.190 --> 16:24.020
What intensity!

16:24.740 --> 16:27.000
He throws the ball immediately!

16:27.000 --> 16:29.410
Will the Italian team be able to counterattack?

16:30.540 --> 16:34.150
What's this?! He threw the ball over to Ohzora Tsubasa!

16:35.060 --> 16:36.300
Come on!

16:36.300 --> 16:37.930
He gave me the ball on purpose...

16:39.540 --> 16:42.380
He wants me to do my Drive Shot?

16:45.980 --> 16:47.890
He gets into shooting position!

16:47.890 --> 16:51.010
Take on my Drive Shot!

16:51.010 --> 16:53.220
Catch it if you can!

16:59.660 --> 17:00.770
Tsuabsa-kun!

17:00.770 --> 17:03.080
All right, it's our first goal!

17:03.080 --> 17:03.820
Go!

17:05.040 --> 17:06.210
He dives!

17:06.210 --> 17:07.810
He throws himself at the ball!

17:07.810 --> 17:12.030
He catches it with one hand, but the ball's still spinning!

17:12.030 --> 17:13.740
Will it go into the goal along with the keeper?

17:13.740 --> 17:14.360
Zino!

17:14.360 --> 17:15.500
Go in!

17:15.500 --> 17:17.260
Come on! Turn into a goal!

17:18.700 --> 17:19.860
Oh!

17:19.860 --> 17:23.390
He uses both hands to kill the spin!

17:23.390 --> 17:25.460
He stopped it!

17:25.460 --> 17:27.290
No goal!

17:27.290 --> 17:29.460
It didn't get past the goal line!

17:30.380 --> 17:33.260
T-Tsubasa's Drive Shot...

17:33.260 --> 17:35.260
He stopped it!

17:35.260 --> 17:40.150
Both players are loudly applauded for their play!

17:41.220 --> 17:45.910
Ohzora Tsubasa's Drive Shot, and the super save by Zino Hernandez!

17:45.910 --> 17:48.720
It's truly the ultimate challenge!

17:48.720 --> 17:50.900
What a spectacle!

17:52.180 --> 17:55.260
Next time, I'll score a goal!

17:55.260 --> 17:56.700
Tsubasa.

17:56.700 --> 17:59.260
What you need are strong rivals.

17:59.260 --> 18:03.410
And the first one is him, Zino Hernandez.

18:03.410 --> 18:08.980
You Japanese are never going to score a goal against us Italians!

18:12.220 --> 18:13.360
What's this?

18:13.360 --> 18:15.180
A perfect pass!

18:15.180 --> 18:16.210
All right!

18:17.940 --> 18:19.170
Hayabusa shoots!

18:20.900 --> 18:23.090
Impressive reaction by Hernandez!

18:23.090 --> 18:25.420
A stand-up catch!

18:25.420 --> 18:26.540
Damn it!

18:27.810 --> 18:30.540
And that is the end of the first half.

18:30.540 --> 18:33.300
All right, you all fought nicely.

18:33.300 --> 18:36.440
But even with our efforts, we haven't been able to score.

18:36.440 --> 18:39.140
They can even stop Tsubasa's Drive Shot.

18:39.140 --> 18:42.800
My soccer's not only about my Drive Shot!

18:42.800 --> 18:45.140
We'll show them our soccer!

18:45.140 --> 18:47.620
Yeah, that's true. Tsubasa's completely right!

18:47.620 --> 18:50.280
The Italian defense is like steel.

18:50.280 --> 18:52.590
The game will be decided by one goal.

18:52.590 --> 18:55.400
Let's put all of our energy into this second half, guys!

18:55.400 --> 18:57.180
YEAH!

18:58.230 --> 19:00.780
This is going completely at our pace.

19:00.780 --> 19:02.900
We're starting the second half soon.

19:03.530 --> 19:04.900
It's about time.

19:04.900 --> 19:06.090
Yeah.

19:10.150 --> 19:12.420
The whistle for the second half has been blown.

19:13.300 --> 19:15.460
Ohzora Tsubasa passes to Sawada.

19:18.560 --> 19:22.540
Oh! The Italians are playing even rougher!

19:22.540 --> 19:25.820
Their ultrafast passes are taking them to the Japanese goal!

19:27.600 --> 19:28.900
As if we'd let you!

19:30.300 --> 19:32.380
Take this!

19:32.880 --> 19:35.620
Oh! Soda's Razor Tackle!

19:36.510 --> 19:38.020
Jito follows up on it nicely!

19:38.020 --> 19:41.060
And both of the defenders are going in to attack!

19:41.060 --> 19:41.900
Good.

19:41.900 --> 19:44.070
Here comes the Japanese counterattack!

19:44.070 --> 19:46.380
The Italian defense slackened during their offensive!

19:46.890 --> 19:47.340
Here!

19:47.840 --> 19:50.190
It's a long pass toward the keeper!

19:50.900 --> 19:52.500
The keeper, Hernandez, comes out.

19:52.500 --> 19:54.110
Let me handle the keeper!

19:54.110 --> 19:55.620
You get the ball!

19:55.620 --> 19:57.220
Okay, understood!

19:59.640 --> 20:02.950
Oh, Hernandez is the fastest and catches the ball!

20:02.950 --> 20:06.340
But if he keeps the ball, it'll be a foul!

20:06.340 --> 20:07.780
He lets go of the ball!

20:07.780 --> 20:10.460
Tsubasa jumps toward the ball!

20:11.540 --> 20:15.010
What's this?! Hernandez clears it with his foot in mid-air!

20:15.010 --> 20:16.700
And now the ball's far away!

20:17.480 --> 20:18.580
Damn it!

20:20.220 --> 20:22.330
The ball's now in front of the opposite goal!

20:22.330 --> 20:25.320
Italy's going for a counterattack!

20:26.300 --> 20:30.780
But Soda and Jito are upfield, leaving only Ishizaki and Matsuyama to defend!

20:30.780 --> 20:32.980
The goal is vulnerable!

20:34.580 --> 20:35.840
Damn it!

20:39.020 --> 20:41.260
Goal!

20:41.260 --> 20:45.660
Conti, who had no one on him, was finally able to score in the end!

20:47.340 --> 20:49.180
They got me!

20:49.890 --> 20:53.780
With lightning speed, Italy scores the first goal!

20:54.240 --> 20:58.180
They got us. The Italians  really <i>are</i> strong.

20:58.180 --> 20:59.270
Misaki.

20:59.270 --> 21:00.010
Yes, sir!

21:02.310 --> 21:05.190
It's been three years since we played together in Japan...

21:05.190 --> 21:10.220
I've been really worried that I might drag the team down.

21:10.770 --> 21:11.860
But...

21:12.290 --> 21:14.140
In the end, I...

21:14.140 --> 21:17.540
I just wanna play soccer with everyone!

21:17.540 --> 21:20.500
And win!

21:20.500 --> 21:23.540
Oh! The Japanese are doing a player change.

21:24.090 --> 21:25.460
Misaki-kun!

21:25.460 --> 21:27.000
Yeah!

21:27.000 --> 21:28.390
It's Misaki!

21:28.390 --> 21:29.300
Misaki!

21:29.300 --> 21:34.070
Number 11, Taro Misaki, replaces Tachibana Kazuo.

21:34.070 --> 21:37.750
Will Misaki's entrance turn around the game?

21:37.750 --> 21:38.880
Misaki-kun!

21:39.300 --> 21:44.300
Tsubasa-kun, guys, I'm gonna give it my all!

21:47.800 --> 21:49.800
And now the game resumes!

21:53.220 --> 21:55.140
All right, we're on!

22:03.100 --> 22:09.060
Preview

22:04.320 --> 22:07.300
It's the International Junior Youth Championship in France.

22:07.300 --> 22:10.470
We've given up a goal, and the situation's delicate.

22:10.470 --> 22:13.900
We'll win for sure, and then we'll go through the prelims!

22:13.900 --> 22:17.830
But in front of Italy's goal is the godly protector, Zino Hernandez!

22:17.830 --> 22:19.020
Let's all go at it!

22:19.020 --> 22:22.180
We'll open the door toward the world!

22:22.180 --> 22:25.060
Next time: 
 Italy's "God of Defense".

22:23.620 --> 22:32.980
Italy's "God of Defense"

22:25.060 --> 22:26.560
Look forward to it!

22:26.560 --> 22:29.140
Let's aim for tomorrow! Goal!

22:33.420 --> 22:37.260
tsumiageru jibun no takasa wa

22:33.420 --> 22:37.260
My skill keeps on growing.

22:37.260 --> 22:41.580
dare ni mo kimerarenai

22:37.260 --> 22:41.580
Nobody can measure it.

22:41.580 --> 22:45.260
komiageru jibun no yowasa wo

22:41.580 --> 22:45.260
The weakness that grows inside me,

22:45.260 --> 22:49.580
dare ni mo miserarenai

22:45.260 --> 22:49.580
I can't let anyone see it.

22:49.580 --> 22:57.540
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

22:49.580 --> 22:57.540
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

22:57.540 --> 23:03.620
aa ima susumu yo

22:57.540 --> 23:03.620
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:09.500 --> 23:13.260
tondekuru koishi wo haratte

23:09.500 --> 23:13.260
I ward off the pebble flying towards me,

23:13.260 --> 23:17.580
bai no hayasa de kaesu

23:13.260 --> 23:17.580
And return it with twice as much speed.

23:17.580 --> 23:21.260
yandeiru kotori wo hirotte

23:17.580 --> 23:21.260
I pick up an ill little bird,

23:21.260 --> 23:25.620
ooki na sora ni kaesu

23:21.260 --> 23:25.620
and return it to the wide open sky.

23:25.620 --> 23:33.540
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

23:25.620 --> 23:33.540
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

23:33.540 --> 23:39.540
aa ima susumu yo

23:33.540 --> 23:39.540
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:45.020 --> 23:49.580
ima daseru subete no chikara de

23:45.020 --> 23:49.580
Using all the strength I have,

23:49.580 --> 23:53.100
koukai wa shitakunai

23:49.580 --> 23:53.100
without feelings of regret...

23:53.100 --> 24:00.580
ima daseru subete no chikara de saikou no kachi

23:53.100 --> 24:00.580
Using all the strength I have, to the ultimate victory.
